      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elbert_County%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1889, Elbert County was reduced to its modern size when eastern portions formed Lincoln, Kit Carson, and Cheyenne counties.",
